					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-2325123#post-3587262</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-2325123/scp-l135-j#post-3587262</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Fri, 08 Sep 2017 02:36:28 +0000</pubDate>
								<wikidot:authorUserId>1875764</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Man, this really does just show the stupidity of cold reading.</p> <p>&quot;Did this person work in retail?&quot;<br /> &quot;Yes.&quot;<br /> &quot;I knew it! That's what they told me!&quot;</p> <p>For real, they're just asking questions and going based on your response or facial expression. If they're so good, why don't they tell me if they worked in retail? If you can read my mind or connect with their spirits, then you don't need me to tell you about them.</p> <p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=t07UzTcApMI">Here's James Van Praagh sucking at his job.</a><br /> Watch this if you want another good laugh at &quot;psychics&quot;. I find it quite appropriate for this skip. Speaking of the skip, got a few laughs, +1.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
